        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>第二招，请用独立赚钱的眼光看职场</title>\n<script>\nwindow.MathJax = { tex: { inlineMath: [['$', '$']], displayMath: [['$$', '$$']] } };\n</script>\n<script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n<style>\n  body {\n    background-color: #1a1a1a;\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 20px;\n    font-family: \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"PingFang SC\", sans-serif;\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: center;\n  }\n  .page {\n    background-color: #ffffff;\n    width: 540px;\n    min-height: 700px;\n    border-radius: 18px;\n    padding: 22px 20px 20px 20px;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n    position: relative;\n  }\n  .title-bar {\n    background-color: #ffe94a;\n    color: #111;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    font-size: 17px;\n    padding: 10px 14px;\n    border-radius: 10px;\n    margin-bottom: 22px;\n    display: inline-block;\n  }\n  .content {\n    font-size: 15px;\n    line-height: 1.75;\n    color: #222;\n  }\n  ul.bullets {\n    list-style: none;\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 0;\n  }\n  ul.bullets > li {\n    position: relative;\n    padding-left: 18px;\n    margin-bottom: 20px;\n  }\n  ul.bullets > li::before {\n    content: \"•\";\n    position: absolute;\n    left: 0;\n    top: 0;\n    color: #333;\n    font-size: 16px;\n  }\n  .highlight {\n    background-color: #ffe94a;\n    font-weight: bold;\n  }\n  .note-box {\n    background-color: #d7f0e8;\n    border-radius: 6px;\n    padding: 12px 14px;\n    margin-top: 6px;\n    margin-bottom: 6px;\n  }\n  .note-box li {\n    margin-bottom: 6px;\n  }\n  .note-box li::before {\n    content: none;\n  }\n  .footer {\n    margin-top: 26px;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    padding: 8px 4px 0 4px;\n  }\n  .footer-text {\n    font-size: 17px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    color: #111;\n  }\n  .arrow-placeholder {\n    width: 34px;\n    height: 30px;\n    background-color: #111;\n    clip-path: polygon(0 0, 100% 50%, 0 100%);\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"page\">\n\n  <div class=\"title-bar\">第二招，请用独立赚钱的眼光看职场</div>\n\n  <div class=\"content\">\n    <ul class=\"bullets\">\n      <li>\n        早在二三十年前，郑渊洁就说过：<span class=\"highlight\">所谓铁饭碗，不是说你一个饭碗你吃一辈子，而是说你那里都有饭碗。</span>\n      </li>\n      <li>\n        经历过口罩事件，见证过太多老板兴衰，百万年薪朋友意志消沉，明确了我一件事，打工不安全。下面有两招，各位自取：\n      </li>\n      <li>\n        1、仔细分析有没有同事，是如何利用公司资源，帮自己形成除了工资以外收入的，你能不能做同样的事情？（身边有，最好学）\n      </li>\n      <li>\n        2、去研究赚钱这件事：工作认真做的同时，利用业余时间，去研究独立赚钱项目，<span class=\"highlight\">去做，真的去尝试做，而不是浅尝辄止，走马观花。</span>\n      </li>\n    </ul>\n\n    <div class=\"note-box\">\n      <ul class=\"bullets\">\n        <li>\n          真心不建议裸辞，不管什么年龄。原因是人对稳定性要求很高，有工作，会稳定很多，反而容易出结果，要不就要硬扛<br>\n          （以前我就不懂这个。。。哎，辛酸泪）\n        </li>\n      </ul>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"footer\">\n    <div class=\"footer-text\">下期预告（现在手头上尝试的项目）</div>\n    <div class=\"arrow-placeholder\" title=\"[Icon: black right-pointing triangle arrow]\"></div>\n  </div>\n\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
